#: CCNCAnimationObjects.py:1852
msgid "Here you can setup CSV import and export settings where you can save and load animation sequences to/from the animation segment list above. You can completely replace the sequence in the list or import segment lists at the end of the existing list"
msgstr "在此处可设置 CSV 导入和导出设置，用于将动画序列保存到上方动画段列表或从中加载。你可以完全替换列表中的序列，或将段列表导入到现有列表末尾"

