#: CCNCAnimationObjects.py:1472
msgid "If enabled, a cuboid is created and placed in front of the camera.This can be used for transition effects like fade in/out or many other things. For the effect box a transparent material will be created which you can use to animate fade in/out by keyframing the alpha value."
msgstr "若启用，将创建一个长方体并放置在相机前方。可用于淡入/淡出等转场效果或许多其他用途。效果盒会创建透明材质，你可以通过为 Alpha 值设置关键帧来动画淡入/淡出。"

#: CCNCAnimationObjects.py:1798
msgid "If enabled, the designated cutter object will follow the preview path."
msgstr "若启用，指定的切割物体将跟随预览路径。"

#: CCNCAnimationObjects.py:1485
msgid "If enabled, the effectbox position will be keyframed at start/endframe with the positions you set here. Keep in mind that the position is relative to the camera position, X/Y is the rectangle of the camera view and Z is the distance. Negative values of Z are before the camera point, positive values are behind the camera."
msgstr "若启用，效果盒的位置将在起始/结束帧以你在此设置的位置设置关键帧。请注意位置相对于相机位置，X/Y 为相机视图的矩形范围，Z 为距离。Z 为负值表示在相机点之前，正值表示在相机之后。"

#: CCNCAnimationObjects.py:1504
msgid "If enabled, the effectbox rotation will be keyframed at start/endframe with the positions you set here. Keep in mind that the position is relative to the camera position and the effect box rotates around it's origin"
msgstr "若启用，效果盒的旋转将在起始/结束帧以你在此设置的位置设置关键帧。请注意位置相对于相机位置，效果盒围绕其原点旋转"

#: CCNCAnimationObjects.py:1520
msgid "If enabled, the effectbox will use a material color keyframe at start/endframe to fade in by setting the chosen color to full transparency"
msgstr "若启用，效果盒将在起始/结束帧使用材质颜色关键帧，将所选颜色设为完全透明以实现淡入"

#: CCNCAnimationObjects.py:1537
msgid "If enabled, the effectbox will use a material color keyframe at start/endframe to fade out to opaque color without transparency"
msgstr "若启用，效果盒将在起始/结束帧使用材质颜色关键帧，淡出为不带透明度的不透明颜色"

#: CCNCAnimationObjects.py:2012
msgid "If not enabled the material of the cutter object will be transferred to the blank object at the cut faces. If enabled, an additional Set Material node is added"
msgstr "若未启用，切割物体的材质将在切割面处转移到坯料物体上。若启用，则添加一个额外的设置材质节点"

